---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Band from "../components/Band.astro";
---

{/* Section headings here describe a clause, not a benefit, so the
    marketing heading rules do not apply. See docs/VOICE.md. */}
<!-- voice-surface: legal -->
<Base
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Subscription terms, cancellation, data export, and software scope for Common Parcel."
  path="/terms"
>
  <Hero>
    <h1 class="t-display">Terms of service</h1>
    <p class="t-lede">Month-to-month subscription terms for self-managed associations.</p>
  </Hero>

  <Band title="Subscription and billing">
    <ul class="rows">
      <li><b>Month-to-month:</b> Subscriptions are billed monthly with no long-term contract requirement.</li>
      <li><b>Published rate card:</b> Pricing follows the published graduated bracket schedule, with a $10 monthly minimum.</li>
      <li><b>Setup and migration:</b> Onboarding and roster and document migration are included with service.</li>
    </ul>
  </Band>

  <Band title="Cancellation and data export" field>
    <p>An association may cancel service in any billing cycle. Financial ledgers, governing documents, meeting minutes, and timestamped activity records with an archive manifest report remain exportable by the association.</p>
  </Band>

  <Band title="Platform scope and legal disclaimer" note="View pricing" noteHref="/pricing">
    <p>Common Parcel provides administrative, recordkeeping, and workflow software. Common Parcel is not a law firm and does not provide legal advice or formal legal representation.</p>
    <p class="coda">Statutory citations and document references are provided for operational guidance. Formal statutory actions (such as notices, fines, and lien filings) require verified approval and signatures from authorized board officers.</p>
  </Band>

  <Band title="Questions about terms" field note="Contact Jesse" noteHref="/contact">
    <p>For questions regarding service agreements or commercial terms, contact <a href="mailto:jesse@commonparcel.com">jesse@commonparcel.com</a>.</p>
  </Band>

</Base>
